                <pb facs="0530" n="458" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg458"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6369/439.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Brown to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Brown says the Nicaraguan minister states that Zelaya yesterday resigned in
                    favor of Madriz, who should reach Managua on the 19th instant.</p>
            </div>
